# The stress generator in Edit mode (M11b, headless): a press of 20 is one
# command group applied in its frame (one undo step), its spawns are
# instances of the enemy prefab, and the saved scene writes them as the
# prefab plus their overrides. Runs on a copy of the content
# (--content-copy).
expect-entities document 17
stress-press 20
wait-frames 1
expect-entities document 37
expect-undo-label Generate 20 enemies
undo
expect-entities document 17
expect-hash document initial
expect-content-hash document initial
redo
expect-entities document 37
save
wait-saves
quit discard
